From 4b8f3116c093e53f176eff41258fad6e6a7acef8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <assistant@wolvcapital.local>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 00:13:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs: fix stale plan names in Terms & surface Starter
 Portfolio terms in-app
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Corrected /policies Section 3 and 7: replaced outdated Gold/Platinum/
  Diamond/VIP plan names and rates with the real live plans (Starter
  Portfolio, Growth Fund, Apex Fund, Sovereign Tier), which is a real
  conflict between the legal terms and the actual product.
- Rewrote 3a and added 3b to spell out the Starter Portfolio cycle cap,
  capital-locking, migration flow, and auto-rollover default/opt-out
  in plain language.
- Added a Starter Portfolio disclosure box (with link to /policies) in
  the investment review panel, shown only when Starter Portfolio is
  selected, so the cycle limit is disclosed at the point of investment.
- Added a 'Full terms' link to the MigrationBanner, shown at the exact
  moment a user's capital gets locked.
- Added a persistent 'Terms & Policies' link in the dashboard sidebar
  footer — previously there was no way to reach /policies from inside
  the logged-in dashboard at all.
---
 app/dashboard/layout.tsx       |  7 ++++++-
 app/dashboard/plans/page.tsx   | 11 +++++++++++
 app/policies/page.tsx          | 12 ++++++++----
 components/MigrationBanner.tsx |  3 +++
 4 files changed, 28 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

